# oracle: pair_style adp on AlCu.adp (Apostol and Mishin 2011, two elements), fcc 3x3x3 cells (108 atoms) at a = 4.05 A, 10% of the sites Cu (set type/fraction; 50% Cu leaves the 4.05 A cell under -40 GPa), 0.05 A random displacements, velocities create 800 K, fix nve, 100 steps; thermo every 20 steps
# oracle-potentials: AlCu.adp
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-9 abs=1e-12
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 1.9e-13, atoms 5.0e-13.
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
lattice         fcc 4.05
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
set             group all type/fraction 2 0.1 1357
mass            1 26.9815
mass            2 63.546
displace_atoms  all random 0.05 0.05 0.05 4711 units box
pair_style      adp
pair_coeff      * * AlCu.adp Al Cu
timestep        0.002
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step pe ke press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          20
velocity        all create 800 4928459 rot yes dist gaussian loop geom
run             100
